  "body": "Turned Coat can only be included in your deck if your deck contains at least 3 cards that take up one or more ally and/or body slots.\n【Revelation】 - Return 2 cards in play that take up 1 or more ally and/or body slots to your hand. Put Turned Coat into play in your threat area. It cannot leave play except by using the ability below.\n<fre> Discard a card from your hand that takes up at 1 or more ally and/or body slot: Discard Turned Coat.",
